WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,413
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:05,781
This is Episode 47.

3
00:00:05,831 --> 00:00:08,201
Maya has a lemonade stand.

4
00:00:08,251 --> 00:00:10,622
Then a dark cloud rolls in.

5
00:00:10,672 --> 00:00:12,537
Pebbles start to fall.

6
00:00:12,587 --> 00:00:14,263
Tap tap tap!

7
00:00:14,313 --> 00:00:15,526
Oh no!

8
00:00:15,576 --> 00:00:17,694
Here comes the big umbrella.

9
00:00:17,744 --> 00:00:18,862
Whoosh!

10
00:00:18,912 --> 00:00:21,451
It pops open all by itself.

11
00:00:21,501 --> 00:00:23,304
Pebbles rain down.

12
00:00:23,354 --> 00:00:24,956
Ping ping ping!

13
00:00:25,006 --> 00:00:26,819
They bounce right off.

14
00:00:26,869 --> 00:00:28,892
The cloud tries harder.

15
00:00:28,942 --> 00:00:30,744
A wall of pebbles.

16
00:00:30,794 --> 00:00:32,702
The umbrella holds.

17
00:00:32,752 --> 00:00:34,460
It does not bend.

18
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:36,722
Friends float back under it.

19
00:00:36,772 --> 00:00:38,722
Maya pours lemonade.

20
00:00:38,772 --> 00:00:40,637
Business as usual.

21
00:00:40,687 --> 00:00:42,469
The cloud gives up.

22
00:00:42,519 --> 00:00:44,110
Sun is back.

23
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:46,121
The umbrella folds up.

24
00:00:46,171 --> 00:00:48,004
Ready for next time.

25
00:00:48,054 --> 00:00:50,215
Not one pebble got through.

26
00:00:50,265 --> 00:00:52,288
That is the big umbrella.

27
00:00:52,338 --> 00:00:54,235
Now you know Shield!

28
00:00:54,285 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
